        "id": "2064066605206643064",
        "text": "i'm building an AI soccer coach to improve my shooting\n\nusing:\n- roboflow RF-DETR to detect the ball / net / player\n- mediapipe to record body angles when striking the ball\n- python to analyze and annotate the video\n\ni'll also try adding a VLM into the pipeline for coaching feedback",
        "author": {
          "screenName": "measure_plan",
          "name": "AA"
        }
      }
    },
