      "text": "testing claude fable 5 to improve the computer vision pipeline for pitch homography, depth estimates, and auto-goal detection\n\nstill using roboflow RF-DETR for object detection and mediapipe for body pose tracking\n\nalso added a ball history trail with colors mapped to speed\n\nmore to come",
